! Oblikovati exporter menu. NX reads this from <UGII_USER_DIR>/startup at launch and
! adds an "Export to Oblikovati" item that runs the managed entry point in
! Oblikovati.Exporter.NX.dll. The ribbon placement and icon are finalized in M7.
VERSION 120

EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

AFTER UG_FILE_EXPORT
BUTTON OBLIKOVATI_EXPORT
LABEL Export to Oblikovati...
ACTIONS Oblikovati.Exporter.NX.dll
END_OF_AFTER
